+# and never links against this target, so skip it for libretro-only builds
+# (e.g. ENABLE_LIBRETRO=ON with ENABLE_SDL=OFF and ENABLE_WX=OFF) to avoid
+# an unnecessary hard dependency on SDL2/SDL3.
